For an exponential function $f$ with $f(x)=5\cdot e^{\lambda\cdot x}$ the following equation holds: $f(x+1)=2\cdot f(x)$.

Write down the value of $\lambda$.\vspace{0,3cm}

$\lambda=$\,\antwort[\rule{3cm}{0.3pt}]{$\ln(2)$}

