The absolute change of a function $f$: $\mathbb{R}\rightarrow\mathbb{R}$ in an interval $[a, b]$, is described by $A$. The relative change of $f$ in an interval $[a, b]$ is described by $R$, whereby $f(a)\neq 0$ and $a<b$ hold.

