The following statement holds: $x>y>0$

The relative proportion by which the product is more expensive in the local shop than from the online retailer is given by h.

Write down a formula in terms of $x$ and $y$ that could be used to calculate $h$.\vspace{0,5cm}

$h=$\,\antwort[\rule{5cm}{0.3pt}]{$\dfrac{x-y}{y}$}

