$$f(x)=\dfrac{x^2}{x-1}$$

\antwort{$f'(x)=\dfrac{2x\cdot(x-1)-x^2\cdot 1}{(x-1)^2}=\dfrac{2x^2-2x-x^2}{(x-1)^2}=\dfrac{x^2-2x}{(x-1)^2}$}

