	$a_1(t)=\begin{cases}
	0{.}6\cdot t^2\cdot(3-2\cdot t)&\text{für}\quad 0\leq 1<1\\
	0{.}6&\text{für}\quad 1\leq t<2\\	
	0{.}6\cdot(t-3)^2\cdot(2\cdot t-3)&\text{für}\quad 2\leq t\leq 3
	\end{cases}$

	($t$ in s, $a_1(t)$ in m/s$^2$).%Aufgabentext

\Subitem{Calculate the increase in speed of this elevator during the time interval $[0, 3]$.} %Unterpunkt1

For the path of an elevator ride, certain criteria regarding the acceleration must be fulfilled. The \textit{jolt}, the instantaneous change in acceleration, should lie between $-1$\,m/s$^3$ and 1\,m/s$^3$ for the entire elevator ride.

\Subitem{Verify if this elevator fulfils the criteria for the jolt at the time $t=1$.} %Unterpunkt2

\end{aufgabenstellung}

