Scenario 1: The annual relative reduction of approximately 2.1\,\% remains constant.

Scenario 2: The deforestation of 17 million hectares per year remains constant.

Scenario 3: The rate of deforestation (in millions of hectares per year) increases exponentially.

Diagram 1 below shows the graphs of the functions $f_1$ and $f_3$, which describe the rainforest coverage according to scenarios 1 and 3 as described above.

