\Subitem{Consider the growth curve for the 50th percentile after a child’s 8$^\text{th}$ birthday. Determine the approximate age at which the instantaneous speed of growth is the highest.} %Unterpunkt2

\item %Aufgabentext

\Subitem{State which statistical value can be read from the 50$^\text{th}$ percentile.} %Unterpunkt1
\Subitem{Describe the difficulties that would arise if you were to attempt to construct a box plot to represent the heights of 8 year-old boys from the diagram given.} %Unterpunkt2

