In households in Austria, various methods of heating are used such as, for example, oil heating (which uses heating oil as fuel) or pellet heating (which uses pellets – small, compacted wood chippings – as fuel).

The table below shows the average annual heating prices for heating oil and pellets for the years 2006 and 2019 in cents per kilowatt-hour (cents/kWh).

\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{|l|c|c|}\hhline{~|--|}
\multicolumn{1}{l|}{}&\cellcolor[gray]{0.9}$2006$&\cellcolor[gray]{0.9}$2019$\\ \hline
\cellcolor[gray]{0.9}heating oil&6,80&7,95\\ \hline
\cellcolor[gray]{0.9}pellets&4,40&4,84\\ \hline
\end{tabular}
\end{center}

\begin{tiny}
Data source: https://www.propellets.at/haeufige-fragen-und-antworten-zu-pellets [13.10.2021].
\end{tiny}%Aufgabentext

\begin{aufgabenstellung}
\item %Aufgabentext

\Subitem{Determine the average rate of change of the average annual price for pellets (in cents/kWh per year) for the time period from 2006 to 2019.} %Unterpunkt1

\item Family Buchner lives in a house and heats with heating oil. The family is thinking about switching to heating with pellets.\\
In order to estimate the total cost of heating with heating oil or with pellets from the year 2019 onwards, the following assumptions are made for family Buchner:

\begin{itemize}
\item Family Buchner uses around 15\,000\,kWh of energy per year to heat their house.
\item The average annual price for heating with heating oil (0.0795\,\euro /kWh) and for heating with pellets (0.0484\,\euro /kWh) remain the same from the year 2019 onwards.
\item The transition from oil heating to pellet heating incurs a one-time cost of 10.000\,\euro .
\end{itemize}

$t\ldots$ time since the start of 2019 in years\\
$K_\text{oil}(t)\ldots$ estimated total cost of heating with heating oil up to time $t$ in \euro\\
$K_\text{pellets}(t)\ldots$ estimated total cost of heating with pellets up to time $t$ in \euro%Aufgabentext

\Subitem{Based on these assumptions, write down an equation of a function for each of $K_\text{oil}$ and $K_\text{pellets}$.\vspace{0,3cm}

$K_\text{oil}(t)=$\,\antwort[\rule{3cm}{0.3pt}]{$15\,000\cdot 0,0795\cdot t=1\,192,5\cdot t$}\vspace{0,3cm}

$K_\text{pellets}(t)=$\,\antwort[\rule{3cm}{0.3pt}]{$15\,000\cdot 0,0484\cdot t+10\,000=726\cdot t+10\,000$}} %Unterpunkt1
\Subitem{Determine the time $t_1$ at which the estimated total costs for family Buchner for heating with pellets are equal to the estimated total costs for heating with heating oil.} %Unterpunkt2

\item The number of pellet heating systems in Austria can be modelled by the equation shown below for the time period from 1997 to 2019.\vspace{0,2cm}

$A(t)=\dfrac{147\,130}{1+31\cdot e^{-0{.}28\cdot t}}$\vspace{0,2cm}

$t\ldots$ time since the beginning of the year 1997 in years\\
$A(t)\ldots$ number of pellet heating systems in Austria at time $t$ in 1\,000s of systems%Aufgabentext

\Subitem{Determine the year during the time period from 1997 to 2019 when the instantaneous rate of change of the number of pellet heating systems in Austria was greatest according to this model.} %Unterpunkt1

\end{aufgabenstellung}

\begin{loesung}
\item \subsection{Lösungserwartung:} 

\Subitem{$\dfrac{4,84-4,4}{13}=0,033\ldots$\vspace{0,1cm}

Die mittlere Änderungsrate der Jahresdurchschnittspreise für Pellets betägt rund 0,03\,Cent/kWh pro Jahr.} %Lösung von Unterpunkt1

\setcounter{subitemcounter}{0}
\subsection{Lösungsschlüssel:}

\Subitem{Ein Punkt für das richtige Berechnen der mittleren Änderungsrate.} %Lösungschlüssel von Unterpunkt1

\item \subsection{Lösungserwartung:} 

\Subitem{$K_\text{Öl}(t)=15\,000\cdot 0,0795\cdot t=1\,192,5\cdot t$\vspace{0,3cm}

$K_\text{Pellets}(t)=15\,000\cdot 0,0484\cdot t+10\,000=726\cdot t+10\,000$} %Lösung von Unterpunkt1
\Subitem{$1\,192,5\cdot t_1=726\cdot t_1+10\,000$

$t_1=21,4\ldots$} %%Lösung von Unterpunkt2

\setcounter{subitemcounter}{0}
\subsection{Lösungsschlüssel:}

\Subitem{Ein Punkt für das richtige Aufstellen der beiden Funktionsgleichungen $K_\text{Öl}$ und $K_\text{Pellets}$, ein halber Punkt für nur eine richtige Funktionsgleichung.} %Lösungschlüssel von Unterpunkt1
\Subitem{Ein Punkt für das richtige Ermitteln von $t_1$.} %Lösungschlüssel von Unterpunkt2

\item \subsection{Lösungserwartung:} 

\Subitem{$A''(t)=0$

$t=12,2\ldots$

Im Jahr 2009 war die momentane Änderungsrate der Anzahl der Pelletsheizungen in Österreich am größten.} %Lösung von Unterpunkt1

\setcounter{subitemcounter}{0}
\subsection{Lösungsschlüssel:}

\Subitem{Ein Punkt für das richtige Ermitteln der Jahreszahl.} %Lösungschlüssel von Unterpunkt1

\end{loesung}

