During a different children's swimming course, the distances swum by 17 children were recorded.\\
The median of these distances swum is 12\,m.

Someone claims that 10 children swam a distance less than 12\,m.

\Subitem{Justify why this claim is \underline{not} correct.} %Unterpunkt2

\item The behaivour of children in a particular swimming group when they first try to jump into the water from the side of the pool can be divided into 3 categories:

\begin{center}
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.5}
\begin{tabular}{|l|c|c|}\hhline{|~|--|}
