Fitness watches are wristwatches that can be used during sports activities.%Aufgabentext

\begin{aufgabenstellung}
\item A 3.1\,km mountain hike goes from the start at 680\,m above sea level to a hut at the summit at 1\,820\,m above sea level. The distance covered is modelled as a straight line with a constant gradient and is shown in the (not-to-scale) sketch below.

